CMXsafe SSH3 identity/mirror integration
Copyright 2026 David de Hoz Diego

This fork is licensed under the repository's Apache License 2.0.

cmd/dial_uid.go is derived from the SSH3 UID helper client developed by
Younes Douici during his CY Tech internship work and is redistributed and
modified with permission from the rights holder. The separately deployed
ssh3-uid-helper daemon remains a formal runtime dependency and is not vendored
in this repository.

The reverse-forwarding dispatcher and direct/reverse TCP/UDP forwarding base
come from SSH3 pull request #166 by Dmitry Mikushin, preserving the commit
history and authorship inherited by this fork.
